    {"who": "stamp", "text": "Here!", "before": 0},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Lumi, why is this an error?", "before": 1.8},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "This is a lexer error.", "before": 0.6},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Lexer error? What is that?", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Before analysing your code, Stamp slices your text into little pieces.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Why?", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Because it helps him understand. For that, he uses what we call state machines.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "What is that?", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Imagine multiple nodes, like a maze.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Here, to enter the maze, you need to find a letter between A and Z.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Then, each small letter makes you turn around in the same room.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "And if it is something else?", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "There is no door for it, so you go out, with all the letters you picked up.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "This little piece is called a token.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "And there is only one maze?", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "No. Words, numbers, strings... each one has its own, with more doors, but it is the same idea.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "For a string, you enter with a quote, and you only go out with another quote.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "So, my line...", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "I forgot the second quote!", "before": 2.6},
    {"who": "lumi", "text": "Yes, he was lost in the maze, and then the line was over.", "before": 0.2},
    {"who": "stamp", "text": "Newline in string. I said it.", "before": 0.3},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Now, check again!", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "stamp", "text": "Lexer... accepted.", "before": 0.6},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Yes!", "before": 2.2},
    {"who": "stamp", "text": "Parser... refused.", "before": 0.4},
    {"who": "mina", "text": "Parser?!", "before": 0.4}
